# The two supported toolchain pairs. `mix loopex.matrix` proves the running
# toolchain is one of them and that both are still recorded here. They are
# validated individually; no cross-product is constructed. Changing a version
# requires an accepted ADR.
#
# Pins are the explicit pairs accepted ADR 0026 chose on 2026-09-13 in place of
# ADR 0002's derived rule. The floor is Elixir 1.18.5 with OTP 27.3.4, the pair
# that carries the standard-library JSON codec the M4 protocol needs; the
# current pair is the newest supported release, which is also Homebrew stable
# today. Hosted CI proves the current pair on every change; a milestone closure
# runs the fast check once under the floor pair through a version manager.
#
# floor pair
elixir 1.18.5-otp-27
erlang 27.3.4
#
# current pair
elixir 1.20.3-otp-29
erlang 29.0.5
